WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.4 · Strategic Foundations
Vision

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A vision describes the better future you want to help create, not your services.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Describe conditions for people or places, not your growth.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Swap abstract words for a condition people can picture.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Test it with someone affected by the issue.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“A living handloom tradition in our district that pays weavers fairly and attracts young people.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write a one-sentence vision and plan who will test it.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
